# Scope control for OpenWiki (https://github.com/langchain-ai/openwiki).
#
# src/generated/ is 1,267 Kiota-generated files / ~305k LOC / 18 MB across 126
# modules. Feeding that to the wiki agent is both ruinously expensive and
# actively unhelpful -- the interesting design lives in the ~3.5k LOC of
# hand-written code wrapped around it.
#
# `widget` (303 LOC, the smallest module) is kept as a representative exemplar
# so the wiki can describe the generated module *shape* accurately. The other
# 125 modules are described from the facade getters in
# src/client/zoho-desk-client.ts and from scripts/generate-facade.ts.
#
# Note: the pattern must be `src/generated/*`, not `src/generated/`. Under
# gitignore semantics a path cannot be re-included once its parent directory is
# excluded, so excluding the children individually is what makes the `!` work.
src/generated/*
!src/generated/widget/

# Build output and vendored/generated artifacts
dist/
node_modules/
package-lock.json
bundled-oas/
tmp-oas/
combined-oas.json
*.tsbuildinfo
*.tgz

# Local runtime state -- may contain real credentials
.env
.env.*
tokens.csv
sdk.log

# Our own wiki publishing artifacts
wiki-site/
.wiki-stage/
.wiki/
